      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Historic Elgin’s Victorian architecture includes Queen Anne homes, and the city hosts the Hemmens Cultural Center and the Visual & Performing Arts Center for performances.",
